What are the advantages of using middleware in Express js ?
=======================================================
1️⃣ Separation of concerns (modularity)
 Middleware helps separate common logic like authentication, logging, and validation from business logic, making code clean and easy to maintain.

2️⃣ Code reusability
 The same middleware can be reused across multiple routes instead of writing the same code again and again.

3️⃣ Better request handling
 Middleware processes requests step by step, which makes request handling more organized and controlled.

4️⃣ Centralized logic
 We can handle common tasks like authentication, CORS, and error handling in one place.

5️⃣ Improved security
 Middleware can be used for authentication, authorization, input validation, and security headers.
6️⃣ Easy debugging and logging
7️⃣ Scalable application design
 Middleware makes the application scalable by allowing us to add or remove features without changing core API logic.

